@startuml
!theme plain

title Traceability UI – Backend Integration (Current Flow)

hide footbox
autonumber

' ═══════════════════════
' SAFE A4 STYLE
' ═══════════════════════
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 45
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 12
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

' ═══════════════════════
' PARTICIPANTS
' ═══════════════════════
actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "Trace UI" as UI
participant "UI API Layer\n(trace-api + decision-api)" as UIApi
participant "Work Item\nController" as WI
participant "Commit\nController" as Commit
participant "Decision\nController" as Decision
participant "Azure DevOps\nAPI" as ADO
participant "LLM Service" as LLM

' ═══════════════════════
' FLOW
' ═══════════════════════
Dev -> UI: Select project and root work item IDs

loop For each selected work item ID
  UI -> UIApi: getRelatedWorkItems(workItemId, project)
  UIApi -> WI: GET /workitem/{id}/related?project
  WI -> ADO: Resolve related work items + linked commits
  ADO --> WI: Related graph + commit references
  WI --> UIApi: RelatedWorkItemsResponseDto
end

loop For each repository group
  UI -> UIApi: getCommitTagsBatch(commitIds, project, repository)
  UIApi -> Commit: GET /commits/tags/batch
  Commit -> ADO: Resolve exact/before/after tags
  ADO --> Commit: Tag and branch context
  Commit --> UIApi: BatchTagsResponseDto
end

UI -> UIApi: aggregateDecision(payload)
UIApi -> Decision: POST /decision/aggregate
Decision --> UIApi: DecisionAggregateResultDto
UIApi --> UI: Decision dashboard data

opt Optional commit review from dashboard
  UI -> UIApi: reviewCommitWithLlm(project, repository, commitId)
  UIApi -> Commit: GET /commits/hf/review
  Commit -> LLM: reviewCommit(...)
  LLM --> Commit: Review text
  Commit --> UIApi: CommitReviewResponseDto
  UIApi --> UI: Show review output
end

alt Session expired (401 from Axios-based calls)
  UIApi --> UI: loginUrl
  UI --> Dev: Redirect to login
else success
  UI --> Dev: Render related results and decision summary
end

@enduml